=== B: 代數定理 z_dev = z_det * (R - 1)  [sympy 精確] ===
  z_dev = (B*(d - 1) - O*d)/(d*sigma)
  z_det = B/(d*sigma)
  R     = d*(B - O)/B
  z_dev - z_det*(R-1) = 0
